<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant" class="scroll-smooth">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>M2 學習單位 7：求導法 互動學習平台</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <!-- KaTeX for Beautiful Math Rendering -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/katex@0.16.8/dist/katex.min.css">
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/katex@0.16.8/dist/katex.min.js"></script>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/katex@0.16.8/dist/contrib/auto-render.min.js" onload="initKaTeX()"></script>
    <!-- Chart.js & Math.js -->
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js@4.4.8/dist/chart.umd.min.js"></script>
    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/mathjs/11.11.0/math.js"></script>
    <!-- FontAwesome Icons -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    
    <script>
    function initKaTeX() {
        renderMathInElement(document.body, {
            delimiters: [
                { left: "$$", right: "$$", display: true },
                { left: "\\(", right: "\\)", display: false },
                { left: "$", right: "$", display: false }
            ]
        });
    }
    </script>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+TC:wght@300;400;500;700&display=swap');
        body { font-family: 'Noto Sans TC', sans-serif; }
        
        /* 實驗室專屬樣式 */
        :root { 
            --panel:#1d2a36; --line:#354553; --ink:#f4f3eb; --muted:#afbec5; 
            --blue:#71b9ff; --green:#8cdda8; --gold:#f3c978; 
        }
        .calculus-lab { color:var(--ink); background:#101923; min-height: 100vh;}
        .calculus-lab .app-shell { width:100%; background:radial-gradient(circle at 85% 0%,#233849 0%,#101923 48%); min-height: 100vh;}
        .calculus-lab .workspace { width:100%; max-width:1440px; margin:auto; padding:clamp(18px,3vw,48px); }
        .calculus-lab .eyebrow { letter-spacing:.22em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--gold); font-size:11px; font-weight:700; }
        .calculus-lab .panel { background:var(--panel); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:22px; box-shadow:0 18px 44px #080f1855; }
        .calculus-lab .field { background:#101a24; border:1px solid #50616d; color:#fff; border-radius:12px; min-height:48px; }
        .calculus-lab .field:focus { outline:3px solid var(--gold); outline-offset:3px; }
        .calculus-lab .btn { border-radius:12px; padding:12px 17px; font-weight:700; transition:transform .18s,background .18s,border-color .18s; cursor: pointer;}
        .calculus-lab .btn:hover { transform:translateY(-2px); }
        .calculus-lab .sample, .calculus-lab .rule { border:1px solid #4a6170; background:#243645; color:var(--ink); }
        .calculus-lab .sample.active, .calculus-lab .rule.selected { border-color:var(--gold); background:#504631; }
        .calculus-lab .rule { cursor:grab; text-align:left; min-height:70px; }
        .calculus-lab .rule:active { cursor:grabbing; }
        .calculus-lab .drop-target { border:2px dashed #657b88; background:#14222d; border-radius:14px; min-height:64px; transition:.2s; }
        .calculus-lab .drop-target.drag-over { border-color:var(--gold); background:#35402f; }
        .calculus-lab .step-card { background:#121f2b; border-left:3px solid var(--gold); border-radius:0 12px 12px 0; }
        .calculus-lab input[type="range"] { width:100%; accent-color:var(--gold); cursor:pointer; }
        .calculus-lab .chart-holder { height:325px; position:relative; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-800 min-h-screen flex flex-col antialiased">

    <!-- Header Navigation -->
    <header class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-700 via-blue-800 to-slate-900 text-white shadow-md sticky top-0 z-50">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between h-16">
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                    <div class="bg-white text-blue-700 p-2 rounded-lg font-bold text-xl shadow-inner">M2</div>
                    <div>
                        <h1 class="text-lg font-bold leading-none">求導法</h1>
                        <p class="text-xs text-blue-200">Differentiation</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <!-- Desktop Navigation -->
                <nav class="hidden md:flex space-x-1">
                    <button onclick="switchTab('concept')" id="tab-btn-concept" class="tab-btn px-3 py-2 rounded-md text-sm font-medium bg-blue-900 text-white transition-all">📖 核心概念</button>
                    <button onclick="switchTab('tool')" id="tab-btn-tool" class="tab-btn px-3 py-2 rounded-md text-sm font-medium hover:bg-blue-600 hover:text-white text-blue-100 transition-all">📈 導數變化模擬器</button>
                    <button onclick="switchTab('practice')" id="tab-btn-practice" class="tab-btn px-3 py-2 rounded-md text-sm font-medium hover:bg-blue-600 hover:text-white text-blue-100 transition-all">📝 互動題庫</button>
                    <button onclick="switchTab('mistake')" id="tab-btn-mistake" class="tab-btn px-3 py-2 rounded-md text-sm font-medium hover:bg-blue-600 hover:text-white text-blue-100 transition-all">⚠️ 避坑與自檢</button>
                </nav>
            </div>
        </div>
        <!-- Mobile Navigation Bar -->
        <div class="flex md:hidden bg-blue-900 border-t border-blue-800 overflow-x-auto justify-around text-xs custom-scrollbar">
            <button onclick="switchTab('concept')" id="mob-tab-btn-concept" class="mob-tab-btn flex-1 py-3 text-center text-white font-medium bg-blue-950">概念</button>
            <button onclick="switchTab('tool')" id="mob-tab-btn-tool" class="mob-tab-btn flex-1 py-3 text-center text-blue-200 font-medium hover:bg-blue-950">模擬器</button>
            <button onclick="switchTab('practice')" id="mob-tab-btn-practice" class="mob-tab-btn flex-1 py-3 text-center text-blue-200 font-medium hover:bg-blue-950">題庫</button>
            <button onclick="switchTab('mistake')" id="mob-tab-btn-mistake" class="mob-tab-btn flex-1 py-3 text-center text-blue-200 font-medium hover:bg-blue-950">自檢</button>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Container -->
    <main class="flex-grow max-w-7xl mx-auto w-full px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8">
        
        <!-- ==================== TAB 1: CONCEPT ==================== -->
        <section id="tab-content-concept" class="tab-content block space-y-8 animate-fadeIn">
            <!-- Hero Introduction -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm border border-slate-100 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-6">
                <div class="flex-grow space-y-4">
                    <div class="inline-flex items-center px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-blue-100 text-blue-800">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-rocket mr-1"></i> 單元導言
                    </div>
                    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900">微積分的核心：「變化率」</h2>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                        在現實世界中，事物無時無刻不在變化：汽車的速度、股票的升跌、細菌的繁殖。求導法 (Differentiation) 是研究「瞬間變化率」的數學工具。透過導數，我們可以精確計算曲線上一點的切線斜率、找出函數的極值（最大或最小值），為日後學習積分和應用題奠定絕對的基礎。
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="w-full md:w-80 flex-shrink-0 bg-blue-50 rounded-xl p-4 border border-blue-100 text-center">
                    <p class="text-xs text-blue-600 uppercase font-semibold tracking-wider">歷史小故事</p>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-700 italic mt-2">
                        「17世紀，<b>牛頓 (Newton)</b> 為了研究行星運動與瞬時速度發明了『流數術』；同時，<b>萊布尼茨 (Leibniz)</b> 從幾何切線角度獨立發明了微積分。我們今天所用的 $\frac{dy}{dx}$ 符號，正是萊布尼茨留給世界的優雅遺產。」
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Formula Grid Section -->
            <div class="space-y-4">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-800 flex items-center gap-2">
                    <span class="w-1 h-6 bg-blue-600 rounded"></span>
                    核心公式記憶卡 (點擊卡片解鎖推導與記憶法)
                </h3>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
                    <!-- Card 1: 基本法則 -->
                    <div onclick="openFormulaModal('basic')" class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-blue-300 transition-all cursor-pointer group">
                        <div class="flex justify-between items-start">
                            <span class="p-2 bg-blue-50 text-blue-600 rounded-lg group-hover:bg-blue-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-square-root-variable text-lg"></i>
                            </span>
                            <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">定義與基本法則</span>
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-4">基本求導與四則</h4>
                        <div class="text-slate-600 text-sm space-y-2 mt-2">
                            $$f'(x) = \lim_{h \to 0} \frac{f(x+h) - f(x)}{h}$$
                            $$(uv)' = u'v + uv'$$
                            $$\left(\frac{u}{v}\right)' = \frac{u'v - uv'}{v^2}$$
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-xs text-blue-600 font-semibold mt-4 flex items-center gap-1">
                            查看乘商法則口訣 <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform"></i>
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Card 2: 複合與三角 -->
                    <div onclick="openFormulaModal('chain')" class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-blue-300 transition-all cursor-pointer group">
                        <div class="flex justify-between items-start">
                            <span class="p-2 bg-blue-50 text-blue-600 rounded-lg group-hover:bg-blue-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-link text-lg"></i>
                            </span>
                            <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">複合函數與三角</span>
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-4">鏈式法則 & 三角函數</h4>
                        <div class="text-slate-600 text-sm space-y-3 mt-3">
                            $$\frac{dy}{dx} = \frac{dy}{du} \cdot \frac{du}{dx}$$  
                            $$(\sin x)' = \cos x$$
                            $$(\cos x)' = -\sin x$$
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-xs text-blue-600 font-semibold mt-4 flex items-center gap-1">
                            查看洋蔥剝皮法 
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform"></i>
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Card 3: 超越與隱函數 -->
                    <div onclick="openFormulaModal('implicit')" class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-blue-300 transition-all cursor-pointer group">
                        <div class="flex justify-between items-start">
                            <span class="p-2 bg-blue-50 text-blue-600 rounded-lg group-hover:bg-blue-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-eye-slash text-lg"></i>
                            </span>
                            <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">超越與隱函數</span>
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-4">指數對數 & 隱函數</h4>
                        <div class="text-slate-600 text-sm space-y-2 mt-2">
                            $$(e^x)' = e^x, \quad (\ln x)' = \frac{1}{x}$$
                            $$\frac{d}{dx}f(y) = f'(y) \frac{dy}{dx}$$
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-xs text-blue-600 font-semibold mt-4 flex items-center gap-1">
                            查看隱函數與對數求導步驟 <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform"></i>
                        </p>
                    </div>
                                        <!-- Card 4: 顯函數二階導數 (NEW) -->
                    <div onclick="openFormulaModal('second_deriv')" class="bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-50 to-blue-50 p-5 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-indigo-300 transition-all cursor-pointer group">
                        <div class="flex justify-between items-start">
                            <span class="p-2 bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-700 rounded-lg group-hover:bg-indigo-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-trend-up"></i>
                            </span>
                            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-indigo-500 uppercase tracking-wider bg-white px-2 py-1 rounded">重點補完</span>
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="text-md font-bold text-slate-900 mt-3">顯函數二階求導</h4>
                        <div class="text-slate-600 text-sm space-y-2 mt-2">
                            $$f''(x) = \frac{d}{dx}\left[f'(x)\right]$$
                            $$\frac{d^2y}{dx^2} = \frac{d}{dx}\left(\frac{dy}{dx}\right)$$
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-xs text-blue-600 font-semibold mt-4 flex items-center gap-1">
                            查看顯函數二階導數定義及範例 <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform"></i>
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Formula Concept Card Modals -->
            <div id="formula-detail-panel" class="hidden bg-blue-50 border border-blue-100 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-4 animate-fadeIn">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-start">
                    <h4 id="panel-title" class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">公式詳解</h4>
                    <button onclick="closeFormulaPanel()" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-600"><i class="fa-solid fa-xmark text-xl"></i></button>
                </div>
                <div id="panel-content" class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed space-y-4">
                    <!-- Injected by JS -->
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- ==================== TAB 2: TOOL VISUALIZER ==================== -->
        <section id="tab-content-tool" class="tab-content hidden animate-fadeIn rounded-2xl overflow-hidden calculus-lab">
            <div class="app-shell">
                <div class="workspace">
                    <header class="mb-8">
                        <p class="eyebrow mb-3">THE CALCULUS LAB / 微積分實驗室 (動態運算版)</p>
                        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold leading-tight mb-3 text-white">看見每一步的求導。</h1>
                        <p class="muted max-w-3xl">輸入任何連續函數，系統將自動解析其結構，判定求導法則並視覺化切線變化。</p>
                    </header>
                    
                    <main class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.06fr)_minmax(0,.94fr)] gap-5 items-start">
                        <!-- 左側：輸入與規則面板 -->
                        <div class="space-y-5 min-w-0">
                            <section class="panel p-5 md:p-7">
                                <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3 mb-5">
                                    <div>
                                        <p class="eyebrow mb-1">01 / FUNCTION</p>
                                        <h2 class="font-bold text-2xl text-white">輸入任意函數</h2>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <form id="function-form" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
                                    <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
                                        <input id="function-input" class="field w-full px-4 font-mono text-white text-lg" type="text" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" value="x^2 * sin(x)" placeholder="例如: exp(x)*cos(x) 或 (x^2+1)^3">
                                    </div>
                                    <button type="submit" class="btn text-slate-900 bg-[#f3c978] shrink-0">動態解析</button>
                                </form>
                                <p class="text-xs mt-2 text-[#afbec5]">支援語法：<code class="text-[#71b9ff]">sin(x)</code>, <code class="text-[#71b9ff]">cos(x)</code>, <code class="text-[#71b9ff]">exp(x)</code>, <code class="text-[#71b9ff]">log(x)</code>, <code class="text-[#71b9ff]">x^3</code></p>
                                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-5">
                                    <button type="button" data-example="x^2 * sin(x)" class="btn sample active text-sm">x² · sin(x)</button> 
                                    <button type="button" data-example="log(cos(x^2))" class="btn sample text-sm">ln(cos(x²))</button> 
                                    <button type="button" data-example="x^2 / exp(x)" class="btn sample text-sm">x² / e^x</button>
                                </div>
                            </section>

                            <section class="panel p-5 md:p-7">
                                <p class="eyebrow mb-1">02 / RULE BLOCKS</p>
                                <h2 class="font-bold mb-2 text-2xl text-white">最外層應用的求導法則？</h2>
                                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 mt-4">
                                    <button type="button" draggable="true" data-rule="product" class="rule btn">乘積律 · Product</button> 
                                    <button type="button" draggable="true" data-rule="chain" class="rule btn">連鎖律 · Chain</button> 
                                    <button type="button" draggable="true" data-rule="sum" class="rule btn">和差律 · Sum</button> 
                                    <button type="button" draggable="true" data-rule="quotient" class="rule btn">商法則 · Quotient</button>
                                </div>
                                <div id="drop-target" class="drop-target mt-4 flex items-center justify-center p-4 text-center">
                                    <span class="text-[#afbec5] text-sm">判斷此函數的「最外層」法則，將積木拖到這裡 ↓</span>
                                </div>
                                <p id="rule-feedback" class="mt-3 text-sm min-h-[24px]"></p>
                            </section>

                            <section id="algebra-panel" class="panel p-5 md:p-7">
                                <p class="eyebrow mb-1">03 / VISUAL SCAFFOLDING</p>
                                <h2 class="font-bold mb-5 text-2xl text-white">動態求導步進器</h2>
                                <div id="current-function" class="text-xl mb-4 text-white overflow-x-auto overflow-y-hidden py-2"></div>
                                
                                <input id="step-slider" type="range" min="0" max="3" step="1" value="0">
                                <div class="flex justify-between text-[#afbec5] text-xs mt-1 mb-5">
                                    <span>辨識結構</span><span id="step-count">步驟 0 / 3</span><span>組合答案</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="step-card p-4 min-h-[120px]">
                                    <p id="step-heading" class="text-sm font-bold mb-2" style="color:var(--gold)"></p>
                                    <div id="step-content" class="text-lg text-white overflow-x-auto overflow-y-hidden py-2"></div>
                                </div>
                            </section>
                        </div>
                        
                        <!-- 右側：圖表區 -->
                        <aside class="panel p-5 md:p-7 lg:sticky lg:top-5">
                            <p class="eyebrow mb-1">GEOMETRIC BRIDGE / 幾何連結</p>
                            <h2 class="font-bold mb-2 text-2xl text-white">即時切線運算</h2>
                            <div class="chart-holder">
                                <canvas id="function-chart"></canvas>
                            </div>
                            <div class="mt-5 pt-5 border-t" style="border-color:var(--line)">
                                <label class="block font-semibold mb-3 text-white">移動切點 (x 值)</label> 
                                <input id="x-slider" type="range" min="-3" max="3" step="0.01" value="1">
                                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 mt-5">
                                    <div class="rounded-xl p-4" style="background:#132736">
                                        <p class="text-[#afbec5] text-xs mb-1">切點座標</p>
                                        <p id="point-value" class="font-mono text-sm sm:text-base break-words text-[#71b9ff]"></p>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="rounded-xl p-4" style="background:#243326">
                                        <p class="text-[#afbec5] text-xs mb-1">切線斜率 (導數值)</p>
                                        <p id="slope-value" class="font-mono font-bold text-lg break-words text-[#8cdda8]"></p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <p id="graph-formula" class="text-[#afbec5] text-sm mt-4 overflow-x-auto overflow-y-hidden py-2"></p>
                            </div>
                        </aside>
                    </main>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- ==================== TAB 3: PRACTICE ==================== -->
        <section id="tab-content-practice" class="tab-content hidden space-y-8 animate-fadeIn">
            <!-- Level Selector Tabs -->
            <div class="flex space-x-2 border-b border-slate-200 pb-px overflow-x-auto">
                <button onclick="switchLevel('l1')" id="level-btn-l1" class="level-btn py-2 px-4 font-semibold text-sm border-b-2 border-blue-600 text-blue-600 transition-all">🟢 Level 1 入門題 (1-5)</button>
                <button onclick="switchLevel('l2')" id="level-btn-l2" class="level-btn py-2 px-4 font-semibold text-sm border-b-2 border-transparent text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-800 hover:border-slate-300 transition-all">🟡 Level 2 進階題 (6-10)</button>
                <button onclick="switchLevel('l3')" id="level-btn-l3" class="level-btn py-2 px-4 font-semibold text-sm border-b-2 border-transparent text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-800 hover:border-slate-300 transition-all">🔴 Level 3 挑戰題 (11-13)</button>
                <button onclick="switchLevel('l4')" id="level-btn-l4" class="level-btn py-2 px-4 font-semibold text-sm border-b-2 border-transparent text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-800 hover:border-slate-300 transition-all">🟣 Level 4 超階題 (14-16)</button>
            </div>

            <!-- Level 1 Questions (Representative Q1) -->
            <div id="level-content-l1" class="level-pane block space-y-6">
                <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 shadow-sm space-y-4">
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                        <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 text-xs font-semibold rounded-full">第 1 題 / 第一原理</span>
                        <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">導數的定義</span>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 leading-relaxed">
                        利用第一原理 (First Principles)，求 $f(x) = 3x^2 - 2x$ 的導數 $f'(x)$。
                    </h4>
                    <div class="flex gap-2">
                        <button onclick="toggleHint('hint-q1')" class="px-4 py-2 bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium hover:bg-blue-100 transition-all">💡 老師提示</button>
                        <button onclick="toggleSolution('sol-q1')" class="px-4 py-2 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-lg text-xs font-medium hover:bg-blue-700 transition-all">🔑 顯示完整解答步驟</button>
                    </div>
                    <div id="hint-q1" class="hidden p-4 bg-amber-50 border border-amber-100 rounded-xl text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                        <strong>老師點撥：</strong> 設立極限 $f'(x) = \lim_{h \to 0} \frac{f(x+h) - f(x)}{h}$。將 $x+h$ 代入函數中，展開 $(x+h)^2$，與後面的 $-f(x)$ 抵消沒有 $h$ 的項，最後抽出 $h$ 與分母相約。
                    </div>
                    <div id="sol-q1" class="hidden p-5 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl text-slate-700 text-sm space-y-4 leading-relaxed">
                        <p><strong>解答步驟：</strong></p>
                        $$f'(x) = \lim_{h \to 0} \frac{f(x+h) - f(x)}{h}$$
                        $$= \lim_{h \to 0} \frac{[3(x+h)^2 - 2(x+h)] - [3x^2 - 2x]}{h}$$
                        $$= \lim_{h \to 0} \frac{[3(x^2 + 2xh + h^2) - 2x - 2h] - 3x^2 + 2x}{h}$$
                        $$= \lim_{h \to 0} \frac{3x^2 + 6xh + 3h^2 - 2x - 2h - 3x^2 + 2x}{h}$$
                        $$= \lim_{h \to 0} \frac{6xh + 3h^2 - 2h}{h}$$
                        <p>約去公因數 $h$ (因 $h \neq 0$)：</p>
                        $$= \lim_{h \to 0} (6x + 3h - 2)$$
                        <p>當 $h \to 0$：</p>
                        $$= 6x - 2$$
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

