                        <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-50 text-amber-700 text-xs font-semibold rounded-full">第 6 題 / 乘積與鏈式混合 (DSE)</span>
                        <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">求導法法則</span>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 leading-relaxed">
                        對 $y = x^2 e^{3x}$ 進行求導，求 $\frac{dy}{dx}$ 並將答案化為最簡因式相乘形式。
                    </h4>
                    <div class="flex gap-2">
                        <button onclick="toggleHint('hint-q6')" class="px-4 py-2 bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium hover:bg-blue-100 transition-all">💡 老師提示</button>
                        <button onclick="toggleSolution('sol-q6')" class="px-4 py-2 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-lg text-xs font-medium hover:bg-blue-700 transition-all">🔑 顯示完整解答步驟</button>
                    </div>
                    <div id="hint-q6" class="hidden p-4 bg-amber-50 border border-amber-100 rounded-xl text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                        <strong>老師點撥：</strong> 這是兩個 $x$ 的函數相乘，必須用乘積法則 (Product Rule) $(uv)' = u'v + uv'$。其中 $u = x^2$, $v = e^{3x}$。注意求 $v'$ 時需要用鏈式法則，抽出系數 $3$。最後抽取公因式 $xe^{3x}$。
                    </div>
                    <div id="sol-q6" class="hidden p-5 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl text-slate-700 text-sm space-y-4 leading-relaxed">
                        <p><strong>解答步驟：</strong></p>
                        <p>設 $u = x^2$ 及 $v = e^{3x}$。</p>
                        $$u' = 2x$$
                        $$v' = e^{3x} \cdot \frac{d}{dx}(3x) = 3e^{3x}$$
                        <p>根據乘積法則：</p>
                        $$\frac{dy}{dx} = u'v + uv'$$
                        $$= (2x)(e^{3x}) + (x^2)(3e^{3x})$$
                        <p>提取公因式 $x e^{3x}$ 化簡：</p>
                        $$= xe^{3x}(2 + 3x)$$
                    </div>
                </div>
